---
title: Contact
listKind: contact
permalink: /contact/
eyebrowText: Get in touch
intro: "PNWORCA is run by a volunteer executive board elected by the member clubs. Please be patient with us, we will get back to you as soon as we can. Mahalo!"
description: "Contact PNWORCA, the Pacific Northwest Outrigger Racing Canoe Association. General questions, race questions and club questions."
---
<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 320px), 1fr)); gap: 40px; align-items: start">
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px; font-size: 18px; max-width: 520px">
<p style="margin: 0">Looking for a specific member of the board? See the <a href="/people/">leadership page</a>.</p>
<p style="margin: 0">For a race, contact the host club. Each race page lists its host, and each <a href="/directory/">club page</a> has the club's contact details.</p>
<p style="margin: 0">To talk with paddlers across the region, join the <a href="https://groups.google.com/a/pnworca.org/g/members">PNWORCA message board</a>.</p>
<p style="margin: 0">Follow PNWORCA on <a href="{{ site.facebook }}">Facebook</a>.</p>
</div>
<div>
<form class="site-form" action="#" method="post" data-endpoint="{{ site.formsUrl }}">
<input type="hidden" name="form" value="contact">
<fieldset>
<legend class="cond" style="font-size: 32px; line-height: 1; color: #1E2427; padding: 0; margin-bottom: 4px">Send a message</legend>
<label>Name <span aria-hidden="true">*</span><input type="text" name="name" autocomplete="name" required maxlength="200"></label>
<label>Email <span aria-hidden="true">*</span><input type="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" required maxlength="200"></label>
<label>Message <span aria-hidden="true">*</span><textarea name="message" rows="6" required maxlength="10000"></textarea></label>
{% set submitLabel = "Send message" %}{% include "partials/form-foot.njk" %}
</fieldset>
</form>
</div>
</div>
{% include "partials/form-scripts.njk" %}
